            "quote": "My blood sugar used to bounce all over the place no matter what I did. I’d eat clean, skip the junk, and still get those nasty afternoon crashes that made me reach for coffee or something sweet just to function. Started taking Avonent a couple months ago and things actually leveled out. The combo of the Ceylon cinnamon and berberine seems to keep things steadier. Energy lasts longer, fewer spikes and dips, and I’m not constantly thinking about my next snack. Feels good to not be at the mercy of my numbers anymore.",
